{"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeThemeSkeletonComponentTokensProvider"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"code":["    \/\/ Define your own provider for skeleton component tokens","    \/\/ by inheriting from existing provider","    class CustomSkeletonComponentTokensProvider: OrangeThemeSkeletonComponentTokensProvider {","","        \/\/ Then override the skeleton component tokens you want.","","        override var colorGradientMiddle:  MultipleColorSemanticToken { colors.repositoryOpacityBlackHigher }","","        \/\/ ...","    }","","    \/\/ Or define your own provider from scratch","    class CustomSkeletonComponentTokensProvider: SkeletonComponentTokens {","","        \/\/ And implement maybe hundreds of tokens.","        \/\/ You are allowed to use semantic tokens providers if you want to define values.","    }"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Then, you can give this "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CustomSkeletonComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" to your own theme implementation:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["class LocalTheme: OrangeTheme {","","    override init() {","        super.init(skeleton: CustomSkeletonComponentTokensProvider())","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"or to an already existing theme for example:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["    OrangeTheme(skeleton: CustomSkeletonComponentTokensProvider())"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It is also possible to use your own semantic tokens providers for this component tokens providers:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["    \/\/ Uses by default here:","    \/\/ - OrangeThemeColorSemanticTokensProvider for colors","    let skeletonComponentTokensProvider = OrangeThemeSkeletonComponentTokensProvider()","","    \/\/ Or use your own color semantic tokens providers (or only some)","    let skeletonComponentTokensProvider = OrangeThemeSkeletonComponentTokensProvider(","                                                colors: CustomColorSemanticTokensProvider())"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"name":"Since","type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"0.9.0"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange"]]},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"class","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeThemeSkeletonComponentTokensProvider"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Class","title":"OrangeThemeSkeletonComponentTokensProvider","modules":[{"name":"Theme Orange"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeThemeSkeletonComponentTokensProvider"}],"externalID":"s:16OUDSThemesOrange0B36ThemeSkeletonComponentTokensProviderC"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A class which wraps all "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"component  tokens of skeleton"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" for "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"skeleton"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" objects like "},{"code":"OUDSSkeleton","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Contains also references to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"code":"AllSkeletonComponentTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"code":"OUDSTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all tokens to the users. It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an "},{"code":"OUDSTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation to use."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Custom themes can use subclass of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeSkeletonComponentTokensProvider","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and apply the provider they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It implements also the protocol "},{"code":"SkeletonComponentTokens","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to expose the component tokens for "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"skeleton"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" through any "},{"code":"OUDSTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Skeleton"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" components tokens are defined with semantic tokens of colors (from "},{"code":"AllColorSemanticTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeSkeletonComponentTokensProvider\/init(colors:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeSkeletonComponentTokensProvider\/colors"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeSkeletonComponentTokensProvider\/SkeletonComponentTokens-Implementations","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeSkeletonComponentTokensProvider\/TokensProvider-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations","t